# ALL runtime campaign data — one gitignored home (ticket 35):
# campaigns/ (nested per-campaign git repos), the engine home, chronicles,
# battlemap sites, map scratch, logs. Nothing a run produces can land in
# tracked space by accident; override with CAMPAIGN_DATA_ROOT (the release
# launcher sets it to the install dir's campaign-data/). Curated generation
# RECORDS stay tracked in their engine trees (dnd-mapping/worlds/...).
campaign-data/

# third-party tool trees — re-obtainable per dnd-mapping/docs/map-pipeline.md,
# EXCEPT the custom FMG headless runner, which is tracked under
# dnd-mapping/vendor-patches/fmg/ (see its README)
tools/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# session-local scratch (ZCode automations)
.zcode/

# LLM provider config (copy llm.env.example; the real one carries a key)
llm.env

# uv
.venv/
